# A release bundle unpacked one directory too deep: the tarball carries
# server/dist/ + package.json, so extracting it from inside server/ lands
# here and shadows nothing while looking like source. Delete it when it
# turns up; scripts/make-bundle.sh writes to /dist-bundle/ instead.
/server/server/
